#82202
"Mountain Ledge - Before a Carved Tunnel"
"The mountain ledge that hugs the cliff for so long to the south of here
abruptly comes to an end before a carved tunnel directly into a mountain
face.  The basalt stone of the cliff face further north is much darker than
the normal stone found elsewhere in the Dragonspires; perhaps this mountain
has seen recent volcanic activity.  Beyond the cliff face, the tunnel opens
into a carved tunnel, eight feet high and half again as wide.  Knee-deep snow
has been packed down by the tread of large, humanoid feet, most likely those
of trolls or ogres.
"
"[Nereus] no.mob to keep the angarlishes out
"
