#82204
"Crudely Carved Cavern - Guardpost"
"This small, crudely carved cavern is barely large enough to accommodate a
handful of ducking ogres or trolls.  It appears that this cave was worked
directly out of the basalt, either to serve as a guardpost or perhaps a
storeroom of sorts.  A pile of large rocks has been heaped along the edge of
the cave, allowing entrance only through a single narrow hole.  The dark,
basalt stone ground is littered with refuse from its occupants, mostly items
not even a troll would eat: tiny, sharp splinters of bone, small, broken
rocks, and fragments of rocky ice.  A finely-carved horn has been built
directly into the rock of the northern wall, disappearing out of the ceiling. 
The cavern slopes down to the east, probably the region this guardpost was
constructed to watch over.
"
"[Nereus] if someone marked comes into the room east, sound alarm
[Nereus] big horn here to blow, sounds the alert
[Nereus] The alarm is controlled from here.  The status0 code being present means that the zone is not under attack
[Nereus] ** Room Finished **
Trolls hair is both swept back and standing straight up?  I get the impression
maybe you mean the hair is standing up at a backward angle but can't think of
just how to put that elegantly just now.  -Talis
[Sohkaar] to troll 'hi' - \"Hi yousself.\"  Should that be 'yourself'?
[Sohkaar] Maybe not... trolls *are* dumb.
"
