#82209
"Carved Cavern - Gathering Place"
"Large but still comfortable, littered with debris but clean in places, this
large cavern is a mix of and seems central to trollish life here.  The dark,
basalt walls and floor are worn to a polished smoothness, due to what could be
years of activity of its inhabitants.  The southern side of the cavern seems
to serve many purposes: that of a guardpost, a storeroom for accumulated
debris of various sizes and a secondary sleeping area.  Cinder-strewn trails
leave this central cavern to the east and west, while to the north, an
unnatural quiet and dim, red glow can be observed.
"
"[Nereus] ** Important Note:  All codes to handle non-combatant movement are here! **
[Nereus] Acode 1 starts all the non-combatants moving in here.  DO NOT MOVE IT
[Nereus] Acode 15 makes them all go home
[Nereus] ** Room Finished **
[Dalthas] do something when you give him food
"
