#82218
"Blood-splattered Trail Along the Crater Floor"
"Partially blockaded by carcasses and piles of gnawed-clean bones, this section
of the volcano floor obviously serves as what would be considered a
slaughterhouse in a human settlement.  The stone floor and the first six feet
or so are splattered with the crimson stains of blood; bloody footprints lead
off along the cinder-strewn ground to the north and west from here.  A
horrible stench of rot exudes from the pile of corpses, furs, and cleaned
bones; apparently the trolls do not differentiate between fresh and more
'seasoned' meat.
"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **
"
