#82219
"Rancid Alcove Along the Volcano Floor"
"This region obviously serves as the latrine of the area.  A deep, acrid trench
parallels the basalt wall to the west with several large holes in the bottom
to allow for a marginal amount of drainage.  Stains of questionable origin
cover the bases of both walls, and it does not appear the trolls are very
careful about using the trench; the cinder-covered stone ground is wet with
some liquid better left unidentifiable.  The cinder-covered volcano floor
continues south and east to cleaner sections.
"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **
Any chance you want to have whatever foul room below with holes that are very
small but perhaps accessable by very small mage familiars (provided the mage
was that cruel to their familiar ;) -Talis
