#82224
"Sheltered Ledge Above Chasm"
"A rather ingenious method, especially for trolls, has been worked out to
contain the pets to this area: a walled ledge overlooking a fall into a chasm
hundreds of feet below.  The snow here has been tramped down by the activity
of the beasts here, but fresh snow has been piled in careful piles along the
northern side of the ledge.  Far off to the west and north, the mountains
begin to drop away for thousands of feet.  Miles to the north, a new mountain
range begins, finally past the grip of the Dragonspires.  A crude stone gate
keeps the pets from mingling with the rest of the trolls inside the mountain.
"
"[Nereus] Trolls will assist the buffalo, but not the angarlish
"
