#82225
"Heart of the Volcano - Altar of Smoke"
"As much as trolls hate fire, it is easy to see why this area serves as an
altar; a place where the ice trolls come to placate forces inside the mountain
that they do not understand.  A dozen or so immense, carved stone blocks, worn
smooth by the worship and curiousity of ages, have been stacked at the lip of
a dimly glowing, sulphorus pit.  Above the pit, an obsidian-lined chimney
rises away, drawing with it the poisonous fumes and smoke belched forth from
the mountain.  Atop the blocks, various offerings have been left, obviously of
no little value to the trolls who left them behind.  The cavern widens
dramatically to the south, although the very high unworked cavern ceiling
continues.
"
"[Nereus] possible link in for an area to jump into the pit here
[Nereus] ** Room Finished **
[Nereus] Maybe a new zone down below will be cool
[Nereus] flame zone, if you have done the liche quest he's in here and will sell a more extended set of crazy other-planar items
"
